[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657939967","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102831#issuecomment-2657939967","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102831","id":2657939967,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ebPH_","user":{"login":"InkONat","id":61206149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMjA2MTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61206149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/InkONat","html_url":"https://github.com/InkONat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InkONat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InkONat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InkONat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InkONat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InkONat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InkONat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InkONat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InkONat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InkONat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-13T23:45:50Z","updated_at":"2025-02-13T23:45:50Z","body":"Also, if you DO add [Export] to one of the properties, it IS shown and updated accordingly as the game changes it. But with GDScript you don't have to add `@export` to make the properties appear on the Remote tab, so I don't think this is intended behavior","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2657939967/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2658105577","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102831#issuecomment-2658105577","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102831","id":2658105577,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eb3jp","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T02:12:26Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T02:12:26Z","body":"There are a number of debugger-related functions not implemented by the C# script language:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f4094b554d6bf15aef155c4e76632f0f0971bb7c/modules/mono/csharp_script.h#L541-L546\n\nI believe the one that needs to be implemented to show properties in the debugger inspector is `debug_get_stack_level_members`. But it doesn't seem like it would be trivial to implement, and it may not be worth it as we're on the process of moving the C# implementation to GDExtension.\n\nAs a temporary workaround, you should be able to inspect all these properties in a C# debugger. See the documentation on [_Configuring an external editor_](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_basics.html#configuring-an-external-editor) for more information.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2658105577/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]